## Weekly board mode
Three Manhattan condo #1s, one per band. Inventory from Zillow and Redfin (condo, Manhattan, in band); attention signal is Zillow saves/day and views/day (format pending approval); record signal values and the date pulled. Status HOLD / NEW / MOVER / CONTRACT / WAIT; full overview only for NEW or changed. Never fake an episode.

## Shared row signature
Wherever a listing appears (weekly board, daily Story deal row, Instagram): band, address, area and price, one italic read, FOR/WHO line, verdict chip. Each product keeps its own palette.

## Compliance
Opinion language, never claimed fact. Public-record anchor for every negative. No engineering, inspection or appraisal claims (point to a licensed inspector or an attorney). Fair housing: WHO is lifestyle, never demographics; schools only from objective third-party sources and never in WHO. Run `compliance-review.mdc` before anything public.
